        arterial-vs-capillary-vs-venous specificity the ICF code makes, and there is no independent
        crosswalk. (Mapping to a single narrower arterial observable such as 252061002 was considered
        and rejected: that would be a narrower aspect, not the function as a whole.)
        """
}
