        active-immunity observables (35123003, 191441008) are all adaptive/specific. The nearest
        defensible FUNCTION ancestor is 35024006 (every non-specific immune reaction is an immune
        response). Broader (low): the target subsumes the source but at the cost of dropping the
        defining qualifier (the SNOMED CT function hierarchy does not separately model innate immunity as a
        function), so the climb loses the source's clinical specificity; 54512006 recorded as the
        related-axis alternate below.
        """
}
